{"sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","items":[{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k001","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"엔트로피는 가능한 미시상태 수와 관련되며 등확률 미시상태에서 S=kB lnΩ이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k002","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"가역 경로에서 dS=δqrev/T이고 실제 비가역 과정에서도 상태함수 ΔS는 가역 경로를 이용해 구할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k003","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"자발 과정은 고립계 또는 계+주위의 총 엔트로피를 증가시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k004","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"이상기체 등온 팽창 ΔS=nR ln(V₂/V₁)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k005","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"완전한 결정의 엔트로피는 열역학 제3법칙에 따라 0 K에서 0으로 정의되는 조건이 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k006","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"G=H−TS이며 일정 T,P에서 ΔG<0인 방향은 자발적이고 평형에서 반응 Gibbs 에너지 ΔrG=0이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k007","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"ΔG°=−RT ln K, ΔG=ΔG°+RT ln Q로 반응 방향을 판단한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k008","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"ΔH와 ΔS를 일정하다고 근사할 때 ΔH<0,ΔS>0이면 모든 양의 온도에서 자발적이고 두 값의 부호가 같으면 온도에 따라 달라진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k009","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"자발성은 속도가 빠르다는 뜻이 아니다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k010","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"생화학의 ΔG°′는 pH 등 변환 표준조건을 반영하므로 화학 표준 ΔG°와 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k011","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"Q<K이면 정반응 방향, Q>K이면 역반응 방향.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k012","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"K>1이면 ΔG°<0.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k013","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"촉매는 ΔG°와 K를 바꾸지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k014","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"상변화 평형에서 ΔS_trans=ΔH_trans/T_trans이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--entropy-gibbs-k015","sectionId":"thermo/entropy-gibbs","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"T>300 K이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}